      "created_at": "2015-02-26T20:49:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The Vengeful Five villains had an easy-to-use team name, so they were easy to refer to. &nbsp;But in discussions about the new villains, I find myself tripping over describing the \"new villains you fight in a format similar to the V5 villains, but there are more of them to choose from... except you can also use them with the V5 villains too.\" &nbsp;And calling the new group of villains the Villains [of the Multiverse] villains isn't much better. &nbsp;So what's the solution? &nbsp;Are they the:</p><p>1) V10 (there are ten of them, right?)</p><p>2) VV (Villains villains)</p><p>3) something else much cooler than either of the suggestions above?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:01.263Z",
