    {
      "id": 134307,
      "name": "Ameena",
      "username": "Ameena",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-27T13:48:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just to check, we can mix-and-match these new guys with the Vengeance Five, can't we? So, you could fight, say, Bugbear, Sergeant Steel, and Proletariat in the same game? If one of the villains is Baron Blade, does he still go first even if the other villains aren't all Vengeance Five villains?</p>",
      "post_number": 17,
