      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-27T13:50:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yep! You can mix and match them anyway you like! I take the Baron Blade going first as a suggestion rather than something that has to be done.</p>",
